# Peter Kamau - IYF Season 10 - Week 2: Advanced Web Development

## Overview
Advanced web development tasks demonstrating professional styling, responsive design, and modern CSS techniques.

## Week 2 Focus: Professional Styling & Design
This repository showcases advanced web development skills with:
- **Centralized CSS System** - Single styles.css for all pages
- **Professional Design** - Modern color scheme and typography
- **Responsive Layouts** - Mobile-first approach
- **Interactive Elements** - Hover effects, transitions, animations
- **Multi-page Portfolio** - Complete website with navigation

## Projects

### 🏠 Main Landing Page
- **File**: `index.html`
- **Features**: Hero section, task cards, skills showcase, professional navigation
- **Skills**: Responsive design, CSS Grid, animations, modern layout

### 🌐 Multi-Page Portfolio
- **Location**: `Lesson 2 Tasks/multi-pages Portfolio structure/`
- **Pages**: Home, About, Projects, Contact
- **Features**: Professional navigation, project galleries, contact forms
- **Skills**: Multi-page architecture, consistent theming, professional styling

### 📧 Contact Form
- **File**: `Lesson 2 Tasks/Contact-Form.html`
- **Features**: Styled form elements, validation, modern inputs
- **Skills**: Form styling, user experience, CSS transitions

### 🎨 CSS Components
- **Central Styling**: `styles.css`
- **Features**: CSS variables, responsive grids, component-based design
- **Technologies**: Modern CSS, Flexbox, Grid, animations
- **Description**: Complete multi-page portfolio website with consistent navigation and professional styling

## Technical Skills Demonstrated

- **HTML5**: Semantic markup, forms, accessibility
- **CSS3**: Responsive design, styling, layout
- **JavaScript**: Basic interactivity and form handling
- **Git & GitHub**: Version control and repository management
- **Web Accessibility**: ARIA labels, semantic structure
- **Responsive Design**: Mobile-first approach

